{"ticker":"WYNN","name":"Wynn Resorts, Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Resorts & Casinos","country":"United States","price":{"last":71.38,"market_cap":7350276096,"pe_ratio":17.117504,"high_52w":134.72,"low_52w":70.8175,"shares_outstanding":102973891,"beta":0.952,"as_of":"2026-10-28"},"stats":{"forward_pe":15.276292,"ps_ratio":0.9914818,"pb_ratio":-42.92243,"enterprise_value":16746824704,"ev_ebitda":9.258,"peg":0.6438,"roe":null,"roa":0.05728,"gross_margin":0.683,"eps":4.17,"forward_eps":4.6726,"avg_50":84.073,"avg_200":99.09335,"target_mean":121.65,"analyst_count":20,"rating":"strong_buy","target_low":102.0,"target_high":138.0,"prev_close":72.42,"day_low":70.8175,"day_high":72.7,"volume":1867269},"profile":{"description":"Wynn Resorts, Limited designs, develops, and operates integrated resorts. It operates in four segments: Wynn Palace, Wynn Macau, Las Vegas Operations, and Encore Boston Harbor. The Wynn Palace segment operates casino space, private gaming salons, and sky casinos; a luxury hotel tower with suites and villas, as well as a health club, spa, salon, and pool; food and beverage outlets; retail space; meeting and convention space; and a performance lake, an immersive entertainment center, Western and Asian art displays, and a gondola ride. Its Wynn Macau segment operates casino space, private gaming salons, sky casinos, and a poker room; luxury hotel towers with health clubs, spas, a salon, and a pool; food and beverage outlets; retail space; meeting and convention space; a performance lake; and a rotunda show featuring Chinese zodiac-inspired ceilings. The Las Vegas Operations segment operates casino space, private gaming salons, a sky casino, a poker room, and a race and sports book; a luxury hotel tower with suites, villas, swimming pools, private cabanas, full-service spas and salons, and a wedding chapel; food and beverage outlets; meeting and convention space; retail space; a golf course; nightclubs; a beach club; and theaters. Its